  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 103.06 Acutely hazardous waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 103.06 “Acutely hazardous waste” means hazardous wastes that meet the listing criteria in 40 CFR 261.11(a)(2) or Env-Hw 405.02(a) and therefore are either listed in Env-Hw 402.06 with the assigned hazard code of “(H)” or are listed in Env-Hw 402.04.\n\nSource. #14278, eff 8-1-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw100.html"
